//! Java 17+ SDK generation for Poolster.
//!
//! This plugin consumes Poolster's neutral [`Api`] AST and emits a self-contained,
//! build-tool-agnostic Java package. The generated runtime deliberately uses
//! the JDK's `java.net.http.HttpClient`; Jackson is the only runtime dependency
//! and handles generated records, JSON bodies, and typed responses.

